<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-PORTO STRIKER DOMINGOS MOVING TO TENERIFE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PORTO STRIKER DOMINGOS MOVING TO TENERIFE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Porto striker Domingos Oliveira said on Tuesday that he had agreed terms for a transfer to Spanish first division side Tenerife.</p>
<p>The Portuguese international, who missed part of last season through injury, said that he would be signing a four-year contract with the Spanish club.</p>
<p>Domingos, 28, was due to travel to Tenerife on Wednesday for medical tests.</p>
</text>
